  "contentHtml": "<p>&lt;재미있는&nbsp;과학수업&nbsp;만들기&gt;의&nbsp;수업관련자료들은&nbsp;선생님들의&nbsp;'협업'을&nbsp;위해&nbsp;공유되고&nbsp;있습니다.<br>수업을&nbsp;위한&nbsp;자료로만&nbsp;사용해주시기&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;<br>**&nbsp;'말머리'&nbsp;에서&nbsp;해당단원을&nbsp;선택해주세요.&nbsp;수업자료를&nbsp;찾기&nbsp;쉬워집니다.**<br><br>#파동&nbsp;#구글문서&nbsp;#가상실험<br><br>안녕하세요&nbsp;과학쌤^^<br>파동&nbsp;관련&nbsp;디딤영상과&nbsp;구글문서&nbsp;활동지를&nbsp;공유합니다.<br>주로&nbsp;가상실험&nbsp;위주로&nbsp;짜서&nbsp;원격&nbsp;수업에&nbsp;활용했습니다.<br>(김정식&nbsp;선생님&nbsp;과학사랑,&nbsp;이동준&nbsp;선생님&nbsp;자바실험실 이용했습니다.)<br><br>1.&nbsp;퍼져나가는&nbsp;파동<br>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aralrM2KU3J3G6epun4zr6PF4nFSyyb7/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aralrM2KU3J3G6epun4zr6PF4nFSyyb7/copy</a><br><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aralrM2KU3J3G6epun4zr6PF4nFSyyb7/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1aralrM2KU3J3G6epun4zr6PF4nFSyyb7/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QctGkI65jE0\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p></p><p><br></p><p>2.&nbsp;소리의&nbsp;특징<br>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15lGNAiMfmDxT4CbJedVpBWOuQZzQZB2C/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/15lGNAiMfmDxT4CbJedVpBWOuQZzQZB2C/copy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15lGNAiMfmDxT4CbJedVpBWOuQZzQZB2C/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/15lGNAiMfmDxT4CbJedVpBWOuQZzQZB2C/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TQr9nsDOoEY\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
